## 6. Analysis Pipeline (Public-Safe)

Below is a simplified, non-sensitive representation of the analysis flow:

```pseudo
INPUT: wallet_addresses[], options { deepDiscovery, walletLabels }

1. VALIDATE
   validate_addresses(wallet_addresses)  // max 10, base58 format

2. INGEST
   for each wallet:
     fetch_transactions(wallet, limit=100)
     normalize_transfers(transactions)
     classify_programs(transactions)  // DEX, token, system

3. ANALYZE — CORE MODULES
   direct_links       = find_direct_transfers(wallets, all_transfers)
   intermediate_links = find_intermediate_paths(wallets, all_transfers)
   common_funders     = find_common_funders(wallets, all_transfers)
   funding_sources    = map_funding_origins(wallets, all_transfers)
   dex_activity       = profile_dex_interactions(wallets, all_transfers)
   token_launches     = detect_token_launches(wallets, all_transfers)
   shared_tokens      = detect_shared_token_activity(wallets, all_transfers)

4. DEEP DISCOVERY (if enabled)
   significant_recipients = score_counterparties(wallets, all_transfers)
   filter_blacklisted(significant_recipients)
   for each discovery_wallet in top_recipients:
     fetch_transactions(discovery_wallet)
     discovered_connections = find_hidden_links(discovery_wallet, wallets)
     classify_connection_type(discovered_connections)
     score_confidence(discovered_connections)
   
   // Extend core modules with deep findings
   extend_direct_links(direct_links, deep_findings)
   extend_common_funders(common_funders, deep_findings)
   extend_intermediate_links(intermediate_links, deep_findings)
   extend_funding_sources(funding_sources, deep_findings)

5. BUILD GRAPH
   network_graph = build_network_graph(wallets, all_findings)
   if deep_discovery:
     add_discovered_nodes(network_graph, discovered_connections)

6. OUTPUT
   return {
     summary, direct_links, intermediate_links, common_funders,
     funding_sources, dex_activity, token_launches,
     shared_tokens, discovered_connections, network_graph,
     recent_transactions
   }
```

