## 7. Blacklist and Filtering System

To ensure analysis quality, Solanalyze maintains a comprehensive blacklist of non-user addresses that are automatically excluded from connection analysis.

### 7.1 Blacklisted Address Categories
- **Jito Tip Accounts:** All 8 known Jito MEV tip receiver addresses
- **Protocol Fee Wallets:** Fee collectors for major DEX protocols
- **System Programs:** Solana system program, token program, compute budget
- **Associated Token Program:** ATA creation addresses
- **Known Bot Addresses:** High-frequency automated trading addresses

### 7.2 Dynamic Filtering
- **High-Interaction Filter:** Addresses that interact with an unusually high number of wallets are deprioritized in Deep Discovery scoring
- **Program Wallet Filter:** Known program-derived addresses are excluded
- **Exchange Wallet Classification:** Known exchange deposit/withdrawal addresses (Binance, Coinbase, Kraken, OKX, Bybit, KuCoin) are classified but not excluded — they provide valuable intelligence

